{"4717260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Are You A Pilot", "steam_appid": 4717260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4726080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You A Pilot is a fast neon arcade runner about reflexes, focus, and one more run. Pilot through glowing space lanes, dodge incoming obstacles, collect plasma energy, fire limited lasers, and push your distance higher while the speed keeps climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with classic lane-based survival in Level 1, unlock the tighter ring course in Level 2, and chase mastery through score, distance, movement, energy, pacifist, and squad challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online features keep the competition alive with account progress, live rankings, squad rooms, bot pilots, and achievement progress. Play solo to master your route or jump into online PvP squad runs where every pilot fights for the top result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Free-to-play arcade reflex gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level 1 lane runner and Level 2 ring course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online PvP squad mode with room codes and quick join</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live rankings for solo and squad scores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Account progress and achievement tracking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable skins and daily gacha-style rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lasers, shields, plasma energy, and escalating speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual settings for players who prefer reduced glow/effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You A Pilot is simple to start, hard to survive, and built for players who like clean arcade rules, fast retries, and brutal score chasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You A Pilot is a fast neon arcade runner about reflexes, focus, and one more run. Pilot through glowing space 